## Common questions

**How do I delete my account?**
Open the app → Home screen → Settings (gear icon top right) → Delete account. This removes your profile, reviews, saved places, friends, and match history permanently.

**Can I use TastePals without friends on it?**
Yes — solo mode lets you browse restaurants, save favorites, and run solo sessions where TastePals picks a spot for you.

**How do I invite a friend to a session?**
Start a session → share the code with your friend → they enter it in "Join a session" on their phone.

**Do you sell my data?**
No. See our [Privacy Policy](https://YOUR-USERNAME.github.io/tastepals-privacy/) for details.

